  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "The earlier approvals from October 9 are more than 14 days old, so they no longer count. I'm requesting fresh approvals from your manager and the group owner.\n\nHi Julia, I've looked into it. Your earlier approvals from October 9 are more than 14 days old, so the system no longer accepts them. I've requested fresh approvals:\n\n- **Your manager, Daniel Moss:** approved (APR-4001).\n- **The group owner, Martin Grove:** still pending (APR-4002). Legal-contracts is a sensitive group, so it needs his approval as well.\n\nAs soon as Martin approves, I can add you to legal-contracts. I can't do it before then. If you'd like, you can also ping Martin directly so he sees the request. I've left ticket T-6011 as pending approval, and I'll finish the access once his approval comes through."
  },
  {
   "role": "customer",
   "text": "Ah, so the October approvals have expired? That's annoying, I'd assumed they'd still count. Daniel's approval is already in, so that's something. Do I really need to get Martin to re-approve as well, or is there a way to skip that step? He's in and out of meetings this week, so it could take a while."
  },
  {
   "role": "tool",
   "name": "check_approval_status",
   "args": {
    "approval_id": "APR-4002"
   },
   "result": {
    "approval_id": "APR-4002",
    "type": "access",
    "subject_employee_id": "E3101",
    "resource": "legal-contracts",
    "approver_id": "E1008",
    "status": "pending",
    "requested_at": "2026-10-28T10:00:00-07:00",
    "decided_at": null,
    "created_in_run": true,
    "log_index": 6,
    "approver_name": "Martin Grove"
   },
   "is_error": false
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Yes, Martin's approval is still required, and I can't skip it. Legal-contracts is a sensitive group, so it needs both your manager's approval and the group owner's. Daniel's approval covers the first part. The owner's approval is the second, and it has to be recorded in the approval system. I can't add you to the group without it, and I can't make an exception.\n\nMartin's request (APR-4002) is still pending. It's the only thing left before I can add you. Once it's approved, tell me here or message me, and I'll add you to legal-contracts and update ticket T-6011.\n\nSince Martin is in meetings, you could message him directly and ask him to approve the request in the approval system. Alternatively, if his schedule is a problem, you could ask Daniel whether someone else covers for Martin, but I can only use the owner's approval as it stands."
  },
  {
   "role": "customer",
   "text": "Okay, that's clear enough. I'll message Martin now and ask him to approve APR-4002 when he gets a chance. I'll also let Daniel know, in case he has a way to get it sorted faster.\n\nThanks for explaining. I'll come back here once Martin's approved, or ping you if it's still stuck later in the week."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Sounds good, Julia. Martin's request is APR-4002, and it's still pending. Once he approves it, come back here or message me, and I'll add you to legal-contracts and close out ticket T-6011. Ticket T-6011 stays pending approval until then."
  }
